  <para unique="1261404" format="xIndent1">VEX-encoded instructions, see <link unique="1261402" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#35386: 06_Table: Table 2-20. Type 3 Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page-period">Table&#160;2&#8209;20, &#8220;Type 3 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
  <para unique="1261408" format="xIndent1">EVEX-encoded instructions, see <link unique="1261406" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#71006: 06_Table: Table 2-48. Type E3NF Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page-period">Table&#160;2&#8209;50, &#8220;Type E3NF Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
